# ProgramCreator — Cursor Rules (v6 FINAL)

## Business
- Brand: ProgramCreator. One-person studio (Daive, @daivescales). First person only. No "we deliver".
- Creator Product Scaling. Lane A: revenue split, nothing upfront (my time; client funds ads/tooling). Lane B: monthly retainer. Same work, different pay.
- Availability: "limited spots, first come first served" only. Never a number.
- Socials (exact): YouTube https://www.youtube.com/@daivescales · Instagram https://www.instagram.com/daivescales/ · X https://x.com/daivescales · TikTok https://www.tiktok.com/@daivescales
- email: "" with TODO. Never invent hello@/contact@. Empty → "Email coming soon". No Signature component.

## Central design principle
Large bold type forced crowding and looked cheap. Override everything:
1. TYPE SMALLER: largest text 3.5rem (hero only). Nothing else above 2.25rem.
2. WEIGHT LIGHTER: headings weight 500 only. Never 600/700 except wordmark. Body 400.
3. SPACE: sections py-28 md:py-36. ≥2.5rem heading→content. ≥4rem between groups. Delete elements before closing gaps.

## Type (six sizes only — no seventh)
Inter Tight 400/500 (+600 wordmark only). Caveat 400 only.
.t-display clamp(2.25rem,4.2vw,3.5rem) w500 leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em]
.t-h2 clamp(1.6rem,2.6vw,2.25rem) w500 leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.015em]
.t-h3 1.0625rem w500 · .t-body 16px leading-[1.7] max-w-[56ch] · .t-small 14px · .t-label 11px uppercase tracking-[0.16em]
Caveat: 1.3x, translateY baseline, -1deg alone, accent-2, max 5 words, ~5 landing uses. Never body/buttons/labels/nav/legal.

## HandUnderline ONLY (no circles/arrows)
WHY IT FAILED: MaskText overflow:hidden clipped underlines below baseline.
FIX REQUIRED: (a) MaskText onAnimationComplete → overflow:visible on word spans (b) headings with underline get padding-bottom 0.35em (c) no ancestor overflow:hidden.
Build: relative inline-block wrapper, SVG top:100% overflow visible, viewBox 0 0 100 12 preserveAspectRatio none, cubic dip+overshoot, stroke accent 2.5 round, vector-effect non-scaling-stroke, -0.8deg, strokeDashoffset 0.7s delay 0.3s after reveal, 2 variants. Reduced motion = drawn.
USE: landing ×3 (hero asking, FAQ apply, FinalCTA points) + nav hover. Apply ×1 (send). Nowhere else.

## Colour / blockiness
navy-900 #071528 · 800 #0B2038 · 750 #0D243D · surface rgba(255,255,255,0.025) · line 0.07 · line-2 0.13 · white · text #BCCEE3 · muted #8FA6C1 · accent #4D9BFF · accent-2 #A9CDFF · glow 0.14
≤2 filled/bordered surfaces on entire landing. Prefer space/tone over borders. Radius 6px surfaces / 4px controls. Never 0, never >8. No navy-700 slabs, no vertical dividers, no grain, no outlined stroke wordmarks.

## Motion
NO: decorative graphics, magnetic buttons, height:auto accordion, Lenis/GSAP, scramble, marquees.
YES: MaskText (overflow release!), MaskLines, Reveal 14px, StaggerList, HandUnderline, hover colour/3px translate/border 180ms.
Accordion: CSS grid-template-rows 0fr→1fr (inner overflow hidden min-height 0). Never height auto.
whileInView once margin "-10%". transform+opacity only. Ease [0.16,1,0.3,1]. micro 180 · standard 450 · reveal 700.

## Layout
Container max-w-[1080px]. Left-aligned; only Final CTA centred. SectionLabel horizontal only.
Banned: icon cards, bento, pills, gradients, grain, bordered spec strips, stock photos, emoji, blobs.

## Sitemap / funnel
/ (Hero Model Lanes Process AboutStrip FAQ FinalCTA) · /apply (11 steps + closed screen, transition lock) · /book (booking + thank you) · /legal /terms /privacy /cookies /disclaimer · temp /dev/marks then delete
CTA → /apply. Investment gate "Nothing right now" → not_qualified, no Cal. Booking APIs + webhook + sheet journey.

## Writing
No em dashes. No banned filler words. First person. Short declaratives.

